(   Anatomy of a C Function:) Tj
T*
(   A C function consists of three distinct grammatical stages:) Tj
T*
(   1. Function Prototype \(Forward Declaration\):) Tj
T*
(   - Syntax: return_type function_name\(parameter_type1 param1, parameter_type2 param2\);) Tj
T*
(   - Role: Informs compiler about the function's signature before its actual call site, allowing) Tj
T*
(   strict compile-time parameter type checking.) Tj
T*
(   - Header Placement: Prototypes are placed in .h header files or at the top of .c files.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Function Definition:) Tj
T*
(   - Composed of the Function Header followed by the Function Body { ... }:) Tj
T*
(   return_type function_name\(param_list\) {) Tj
T*
(   /* Local variable declarations */) Tj
T*
(   /* Executable statements */) Tj
T*
(   return result_value;) Tj
T*
(   }) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Function Call and Calling Conventions:) Tj
T*
(   - Syntax: result = function_name\(arg1, arg2\);) Tj
T*
(   - Calling Convention \(e.g., cdecl on x86, System V AMD64 ABI on x86-64\):) Tj
T*
(   a. Caller evaluates actual arguments right-to-left and pushes them onto the stack or passes) Tj
T*
(   them in designated CPU registers \(RDI, RSI, RDX, RCX, R8, R9\).) Tj
T*
(   b. Caller executes 'call' instruction, pushing the Return Address onto the stack.) Tj
T*
(   c. Callee executes its body and places return value in RAX/EAX register.) Tj
T*
(   d. Callee executes 'ret', popping return address back into instruction pointer \(RIP/EIP\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Annotated ANSI C Code Listing:) Tj
T*
(   #include <stdio.h>) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   /* 1. Function Prototype Declaration */) Tj
T*
(   double compute_kinetic_velocity\(double substrate_conc, double vmax, double km\);) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   int main\(void\) {) Tj
T*
(   double s = 2.5; /* Substrate concentration [S] in mM */) Tj
T*
(   double vmax = 100.0; /* Vmax in umol/min */) Tj
T*
(   double km = 1.2; /* Michaelis constant Km in mM */) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   /* 2. Function Invocation */) Tj
T*
(   double v0 = compute_kinetic_velocity\(s, vmax, km\);) Tj
T*
(   printf\("Initial Reaction Velocity \(v0\): %.2f umol/min\\n", v0\);) Tj
T*
(   return 0;) Tj
T*
(   }) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   /* 3. Function Definition \(Michaelis-Menten Enzyme Kinetics\) */) Tj
T*
(   double compute_kinetic_velocity\(double substrate_conc, double vmax, double km\) {) Tj
T*
(   if \(substrate_conc < 0.0 || \(km + substrate_conc\) <= 0.0\) {) Tj
T*
(   return 0.0;) Tj
T*
(   }) Tj
T*
(   /* v0 = \(Vmax * [S]\) / \(Km + [S]\) */) Tj
T*
(   double velocity = \(vmax * substrate_conc\) / \(km + substrate_conc\);) Tj
T*
(   return velocity; /* 4. Return statement yielding computed scalar */) Tj
T*
(   }) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET

endstream
