(   [Problem Statement]: Explain Tail Recursion vs Non-Tail Recursion in C, detailing Tail Call Optimization \(TCO\) and stack frame recycling.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Tail Recursion and Tail Call Optimization \(TCO\):) Tj
T*
(   1. Conceptual Distinction:) Tj
T*
(   - Non-Tail Recursion: The recursive call is NOT the final operation of the function. After the) Tj
T*
(   recursive call returns, additional computations \(e.g., multiplication, addition\) remain to be) Tj
T*
(   performed. The caller's stack frame MUST be preserved on the stack.) Tj
T*
(   Example: return n * fact\(n - 1\); /* Multiplication occurs AFTER call returns */) Tj
T*
(   - Tail Recursion: The recursive invocation is the ABSOLUTE FINAL expression executed in the) Tj
T*
(   function. The function immediately returns the value returned by the recursive call without) Tj
T*
(   further calculation.) Tj
T*
(   Example: return fact_tail\(n - 1, acc * n\);) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Tail Call Optimization \(TCO\):) Tj
T*
(   - When a function call is in tail position, there is no need to preserve the caller's stack) Tj
T*
(   frame because the caller has no further work to do!) Tj
T*
(   - An optimizing compiler \(GCC with -O2 or -O3\) REUSES / OVERWRITES the existing stack frame,) Tj
T*
(   resetting parameters and jumping to the top of the function via an assembly JMP instruction!) Tj
T*
(   - Transforms O\(N\) stack space complexity into O\(1\) constant stack space, completely eliminating) Tj
T*
(   the possibility of stack overflow!) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Code Comparison \(Converting Non-Tail to Tail Recursion\):) Tj
T*
(   #include <stdio.h>) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   /* Non-Tail Recursive: O\(N\) stack frames */) Tj
T*
(   unsigned long long fact_non_tail\(unsigned int n\) {) Tj
T*
(   if \(n == 0\) return 1ULL;) Tj
T*
(   return n * fact_non_tail\(n - 1\); /* Non-tail! */) Tj
T*
(   }) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   /* Tail Recursive Helper: O\(1\) stack frames with TCO */) Tj
T*
(   unsigned long long fact_tail_helper\(unsigned int n, unsigned long long accumulator\) {) Tj
T*
(   if \(n == 0\) return accumulator;) Tj
T*
(   return fact_tail_helper\(n - 1, accumulator * n\); /* Tail call! */) Tj
T*
(   }) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   unsigned long long fact_tail\(unsigned int n\) {) Tj
T*
(   return fact_tail_helper\(n, 1ULL\);) Tj
T*
(   }) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   int main\(void\) {) Tj
T*
(   printf\("Non-Tail 5! = %llu\\n", fact_non_tail\(5\)\);) Tj
T*
(   printf\("Tail-Opt 5! = %llu\\n", fact_tail\(5\)\);) Tj
T*
(   return 0;) Tj
T*
(   }) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET

