(   [Problem Statement]: Detail the four C Storage Classes \(auto, register, static, extern\), comparing storage duration, scope, and memory segment allocation.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   The Four C Storage Classes: Detailed Comparison:) Tj
T*
(   Storage classes determine the scope \(visibility\), lifetime \(duration\), and physical memory) Tj
T*
(   location of variables in C.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   1. auto \(Automatic\):) Tj
T*
(   - Scope: Local block scope.) Tj
T*
(   - Lifetime: Block duration \(created on entry into block, destroyed upon exit\).) Tj
T*
(   - Storage Location: Call Stack.) Tj
T*
(   - Default: Default for all local variables declared inside functions.) Tj
T*
(   - Initialization: Contains uninitialized garbage values.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. register:) Tj
T*
(   - Scope: Local block scope.) Tj
T*
(   - Lifetime: Block duration.) Tj
T*
(   - Storage Location: Microprocessor CPU Registers \(if available; otherwise stack\).) Tj
T*
(   - Key Restriction: Address-of operator \(&\) CANNOT be applied \(registers have no RAM memory) Tj
T*
(   address\).) Tj
T*
(   - Usage: Performance optimization hint for frequently incremented loop counters.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. static:) Tj
T*
(   - Case A: Local Static Variable:) Tj
T*
(   - Scope: Local to enclosing block.) Tj
T*
(   - Lifetime: Entire program execution \(created at program startup, persists until exit\).) Tj
T*
(   - Storage Location: Data Segment \(.data if initialized, .bss if uninitialized\).) Tj
T*
(   - Retains value between consecutive function invocations. Initialized exactly ONCE.) Tj
T*
(   - Case B: Global Static Variable / Function:) Tj
T*
(   - Scope: File scope with INTERNAL LINKAGE. Visible only within the defining translation unit) Tj
T*
(   \(.c file\). Prevents global name clashes.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. extern \(External\):) Tj
T*
(   - Scope: Global / File scope with EXTERNAL LINKAGE.) Tj
T*
(   - Lifetime: Entire program execution.) Tj
T*
(   - Storage Location: Data / BSS Segment.) Tj
T*
(   - Purpose: Declares a variable or function that is physically defined and allocated in another) Tj
T*
(   source file. Informs linker to resolve symbol.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   Summary Table:) Tj
T*
(   Storage Class Keyword Storage Location Initial Value Scope Lifetime) Tj
T*
(   Automatic auto Stack Garbage Local Block Block execution) Tj
T*
(   Register register CPU Register Garbage Local Block Block execution) Tj
T*
(   Static \(Local\) static Data/BSS Segment Zero \(0\) Local Block Program duration) Tj
T*
(   Static \(Global\) static Data/BSS Segment Zero \(0\) File \(Internal\) Program duration) Tj
T*
(   External extern Data/BSS Segment Zero \(0\) Global \(External\) Program duration) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
