(   [Problem Statement]: Write an ANSI C program implementing a modular function to transcribe a DNA coding sequence into messenger RNA \(mRNA\).) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   DNA to mRNA Transcription Module:) Tj
T*
(   1. Biological Mechanism:) Tj
T*
(   - Transcription converts double-stranded DNA into single-stranded messenger RNA.) Tj
T*
(   - The coding strand of DNA matches mRNA, except every occurrence of Thymine \(T\) is replaced by) Tj
T*
(   Uracil \(U\).) Tj
T*
(   - Other bases \(Adenine A, Cytosine C, Guanine G\) remain unchanged.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Complete ANSI C Source Code:) Tj
T*
(   #include <stdio.h>) Tj
T*
(   #include <string.h>) Tj
T*
(   #include <ctype.h>) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   void transcribe_dna_to_mrna\(const char *dna, char *mrna, int max_buffer\) {) Tj
T*
(   int i = 0;) Tj
T*
(   while \(dna[i] != '\\0' && i < max_buffer - 1\) {) Tj
T*
(   char base = toupper\(\(unsigned char\)dna[i]\);) Tj
T*
(   if \(base == 'T'\) {) Tj
T*
(   mrna[i] = 'U';) Tj
T*
(   } else {) Tj
T*
(   mrna[i] = base;) Tj
T*
(   }) Tj
T*
(   i++;) Tj
T*
(   }) Tj
T*
(   mrna[i] = '\\0'; /* Ensure proper null termination */) Tj
T*
(   }) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   int main\(void\) {) Tj
T*
(   const char *dna_coding_strand = "ATGGCATTCGGTTAA";) Tj
T*
(   char mrna_transcript[64];) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   transcribe_dna_to_mrna\(dna_coding_strand, mrna_transcript, sizeof\(mrna_transcript\)\);) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
