(   2. Floating-Point Subtraction Trap:) Tj
T*
(   Subtracting floats and casting to int \(\(int\)\(*f1 - *f2\)\) fails if difference is between 0.0 and) Tj
T*
(   1.0 \(truncates to 0\)! Must use explicit comparison.) Tj
