(   Variable Shadowing in Nested Scopes:) Tj
T*
(   1. Definition:) Tj
T*
(   Variable shadowing occurs when an identifier declared within an inner block shares the exact) Tj
T*
(   same name as an identifier in an outer scope.) Tj
T*
(   Inside the inner block, the outer variable is 'shadowed' \(hidden\); all references resolve) Tj
