T*
(   - Execution Order: Executed in STRICT REVERSE ORDER OF REGISTRATION \(LIFO - Last In, First) Tj
T*
(   Out\).) Tj
T*
(   - Limitations: Not executed if program terminates abnormally via abort\(\) or crashes due to) Tj
T*
(   segmentation fault.) Tj
