(   3. Safe Solutions:) Tj
T*
(   - Solution 1: Allocate dynamically on the heap: int *p = malloc\(sizeof\(int\)\);) Tj
T*
(   - Solution 2: Have caller allocate memory and pass the pointer into the function.) Tj
T*
(   - Solution 3: Use static storage duration: static int val = 42;) Tj
